      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p><strong>Greendale Logistics Expands Regional Network</strong></p><p>Greendale Logistics announced last week that it will open three new distribution centers across the northern region by the end of the year. The expansion <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[116]</mark> the company’s effort to reduce delivery times for its growing base of online retail clients. Over the past two years, demand for next-day shipping has risen sharply.</p><p><mark class=\"erq-blank\">[117]</mark> Chief Operating Officer Maria Delgado explained that the new facilities will allow Greendale to store inventory closer to major population centers. “Customers increasingly expect their orders to arrive within a day,” she said. “These centers will help us meet that <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[118]</mark> without raising costs.”</p><p>The first center is scheduled to begin operations in March. Greendale expects to hire approximately 400 new employees <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[119]</mark> the three sites once they are fully operational.</p></div>",
