      "passageHtml": "\n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#fff; border:1px solid #cbd5e0; border-radius:10px; padding:14px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#254337; margin-bottom:6px; font-size:0.9rem;\"><i class=\"fas fa-globe\"></i> Document 1: Service Webpage</div>\n        <div class=\"erq-pdoc\"><div class=\"erq-doc\"><div class=\"erq-doc-label\">Notice</div><div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Greenhollow Community Library — Service Update</strong></p><p>Starting Saturday, 5 July, the library will launch a new self-checkout system at all three branches. The system allows members to borrow up to ten items without staff assistance. To use it, simply scan your membership card, then scan each item.</p><p>Please note the following during the transition:</p><p>• For the first two weeks, a volunteer will be stationed near each machine to help members unfamiliar with the process.<br/>• The returns desk will continue to be staffed as usual; only checkouts are affected.<br/>• Members with overdue fines must still settle them at the front desk, as the machines cannot process payments.</p><p>We expect shorter wait times once members grow comfortable with the new system. Questions may be directed to your branch coordinator.</p></div></div><div class=\"erq-doc\"><div class=\"erq-doc-label\">Text message</div><div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p><strong>Renata:</strong> Hey, did you go to the Westbrook branch today? I wanted to grab those cooking books before the weekend.</p><p><strong>Tomas:</strong> I did. Heads up — they just put in those new self-checkout machines. I tried one but it wouldn’t let me check out.</p><p><strong>Renata:</strong> Really? Was it broken?</p><p><strong>Tomas:</strong> No, turns out I had a late fee from that history book I returned last month. The machine couldn’t take the payment, so I had to go to the desk anyway.</p><p><strong>Renata:</strong> Ah, good to know. I’ll bring some cash just in case. Thanks!</p></div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #cbd5e0; border-radius:10px; padding:14px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#254337; margin-bottom:6px; font-size:0.9rem;\"><i class=\"fas fa-table\"></i> Document 2: Session Timetable & Fees</div>\n        <div class=\"erq-doc\"><div class=\"erq-doc-label\">Notice - Bulletin #7</div><div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE: Facility Schedule Adjustment</strong><br>Please be advised that scheduled renovations will commence on Monday morning at 9:00 A.M. All employees and visitors are requested to check in with their confirmation badge at the reception desk upon arrival. If you have any inquiries or require special accommodations, please contact the customer service hotline at extension 401. Thank you for your continued cooperation.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#f0fff4; border:1px solid #9ae6b4; border-radius:10px; padding:14px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#276749; margin-bottom:6px; font-size:0.9rem;\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope-open-text\"></i> Document 3: Official Confirmation Notice</div>\n        <div class=\"erq-doc\"><div class=\"erq-doc-label\">Notice - Bulletin #8</div><div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE: Facility Schedule Adjustment</strong><br>Please be advised that scheduled renovations will commence on Monday morning at 9:00 A.M. All employees and visitors are requested to check in with their confirmation badge at the reception desk upon arrival. If you have any inquiries or require special accommodations, please contact the customer service hotline at extension 401. Thank you for your continued cooperation.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ",
